        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 222201, Rectangular Privacy Lock for Barn Doors</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Barn Door Privacy Lock mounts to the interior side of the door and the jamb. When activated, the latch secures the door closed. A Privacy Barn Door Lock like this one also includes an emergency release hole and egress pin to unlatch the door from the outside. Emtek 222201's new Rectangular Privacy Lock for Barn Doors is available in an wide array of modern finish colors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Barn Door Privacy Lock:</b> Locks but has access to unlock from the outside via emergency release pin. Privacy locks do not offer security, they offer privacy.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-222201-Installed.gif?v=1704354675\" width=\"426\" height=\"364\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek 222201 Installed\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Modern Rectangular Barn Door Privacy Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Surface Bolt Height: 7-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Surface Bolt Width: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Surface Bolt Thumbturn Length: 2-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Surface Bolt Projection: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Height: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Width: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Minimum Door Thickness: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-222201-Specification.pdf?v=1704262402\"><b>Emtek 222201 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-222201-Install.pdf?v=1704262402\"><b>Emtek 222201 Installation Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> (1) trim escutcheon with thumbturn, (1) strike, (1) emergency release key, and the mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-barndoor-finishes.jpg?v=1704354676\" width=\"514\" height=\"226\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
